==Trivia==
*Phase Six is the first phase:
**Since [[Phase One]]:
***To not have a [[Guardians of the Galaxy]] project.
**Since [[Phase Three]] to have an [[Avengers]] film.
**Since [[Phase Four]] to have a [[Marvel Studios' Special Presentations|Special Presentation]].
**To begin the same year the previous phase concluded.
**To contain less than six films.
**To have a [[The Punisher: One Last Kill|TV-MA]] Special Presentation.
**To have only one television series release in a year.
*Phase Six is the second phase:
**To have both an [[Avengers]] film and a [[Spider-Man]] film release in the same year.
**To have two [[Avengers]] films.
*The TV series ''[[Eyes of Wakanda]]'' and ''[[Marvel Zombies]]'' released during the same time period as Phase Six.

